  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/242/379/64/64/637134045284508458.png\" alt=\"Auth Me图标\"></p><h1>Auth Me</h1><p>在Minecraft中进行身份认证并重新验证会话</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/actions/workflows/release.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/axieum/authme/release.yml?branch=main&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"构建状态\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/axieum/authme?style=for-the-badge&amp;include_prereleases&amp;sort=semver\" alt=\"版本发布\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auth-me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/Available For_356643_latest.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"适用版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auth-me/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_356643_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下载量\"></a></p><p>Auth Me是一个<strong>Minecraft模组</strong>，通过在游戏中实现账户认证功能，旨在解决连接服务器时臭名昭著的会话验证错误问题。</p><p>这是一个<strong>仅客户端</strong>的模组，适用于现代版本的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft</a> Java版。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/demo.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Auth Me演示\"></p><h4>替代方案</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TechnicianLP/ReAuth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ReAuth</a> by TechnicianLP</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Sintinium/oauth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OAuth</a> by Sintinium</li>\n</ul><h2>赞助者</h2><p>我们要特别感谢以下赞助者对Auth Me开发的支持。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252faxieum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/b9fe4fbe-8cc4-42cc-a545-dfd1b46d20e6.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p><h2>贡献指南</h2><p>感谢您考虑为Auth Me贡献力量！请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">贡献指南</a>。</p><h2>安全漏洞</h2><p>请查阅<a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/.github/SECURITY.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">安全政策</a>了解如何报告安全漏洞。</p><h2>许可证</h2><p>Auth Me是遵循<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopensource.org%252flicenses%252fMIT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT许可证</a>的开源软件。</p>",
